OL,3,ATories pledge to bring back tax-free
OL,4,Ashopping for tourists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative Party has pledged to
OL,7,Fbring back tax-free shopping for
OL,8,Ftourists from outside the European
OL,9,FUnion.
OL,11,FThe Tories said the decision to scrap
OL,12,Fthe scheme in 2021 left the UK less
OL,13,Fcompetitive than European destinations.
OL,15,FLeader Kemi Badenoch, who was a
OL,16,FTreasury minister when the tax relief
OL,17,Fwas abolished, said businesses were
OL,18,Fbeing "let down by a tax policy that is
OL,19,Fchasing their customers away".
OL,21,FBut Labour accused the party of "a
OL,22,Fspectacular U-turn".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
